GitHub-style completion density per day (from done events)

Usage: tasqx chart heatmap [OPTIONS] [FILTER]...

Arguments:
  [FILTER]...  Filter DSL — see `throughput`'s

Options:
      --json             Print the raw JSON API result instead of the human table
      --year             Show a full year (52 weeks)
      --theme <THEME>    Theme name (built-in nord|gruvbox|dracula|solarized|mono, or a user file). Overrides $TASQX_THEME and the config file (DESIGN.md §8)
      --weeks <WEEKS>    Number of weeks to show (1-520; default 12; overrides --year)
      --socket <SOCKET>  Local socket / named-pipe address of a tasqx daemon. Overrides $TASQX_SOCK. When a daemon is reachable, one-shot commands route through it (single writer); otherwise they run in-process. Also selects the address for `daemon` and `watch`
      --no-daemon        Never route through a daemon; always run one-shot in-process (the pre-daemon behaviour). Escape hatch for scripts
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
